# Disable autocrlf on generated files, they always generate with LF
# Add any extra files or paths here to make git stop saying they
# are changed when only line endings change.
src/generated/**/.cache/cache text eol=lf
src/generated/**/*.json text eol=lf

# The maven repo is served straight from raw.githubusercontent, so the bytes git
# stores are the bytes a consumer downloads. Publishing generates the poms and
# maven-metadata.xml with CRLF and checksums to match, and autocrlf was rewriting
# them to LF on the way into the index, which broke every published .sha1/.md5.
# Store this tree verbatim.
mcmodsrepo/** -text
